  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞“放学后的恶灵俱乐部”……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_012.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0C 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}看来已经没有阴影了，\n由加莉亲，这下没问题了吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_012.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 05 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}少看不起人。\n我只是有点怕黑而已。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_012.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 07 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}其实桐条学姐比我还害怕呢。\n绝对是。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_012.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……我不明白你在说什么。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_012.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}确实很害怕{F5 47 02 01 03 01 07 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_012.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}你身后有人{F5 47 02 01 03 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_012.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}真是的……怎么连你也这么说？\n难道你以为我到了这年纪，\n还会相信幽灵这种东西吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_012.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}未免太小看我了。\n听好了，我将来可是要\n肩负桐条集团的人，居然……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_012.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}啊，好了，我知道了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_012.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}紧急情况！\n美鹤的心率已升至\n平时的约２倍。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_012.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}体温也在上升……\n０．５度……０．６度、０．７度！\n另外，目前已是大汗淋漓状态！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e600/e600_012.bf.json:8:0",
